IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ENTRYJOB.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 ROWS-PARAMS.
  05 ROWS-FUNCTION PIC X(8).
  05 ROWS-STATUS PIC X(4).
01 APPROVED PIC X.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    PERFORM 3000-READ.
    IF APPROVED = 'Y'
        PERFORM 2000-WRITE
    END-IF.
    GOBACK.
3000-READ SECTION.
    MOVE 'ADVANCE' TO ROWS-FUNCTION.
    CALL 'ROWSIO' USING ROWS-PARAMS.
2000-WRITE SECTION.
    MOVE 'STORE' TO ROWS-FUNCTION.
    CALL 'ROWSIO' USING ROWS-PARAMS.
